montyBorderOldT -- full monty step 3, group 1 (2026-11-27): drawFill, drawBorder and drawImage are marked newRoad in incant/utilities.

This file is one of five. montyNewT shows firstLight as it is: the three bodies run on kantGrammar. The other four put a
registry of OLD-ROAD copies (the same bodies, unmarked) ahead of Utilities before the first show, so drawWalk and
drawKids bind to the copies: montyOldT copies all three, montyFillOldT, montyBorderOldT and montyImageOldT one each.
The harness (genLadder/formsPop.sh) arms INCANT_NEWROAD_CALLS and reads, per run: how many calls of each body went
through the new-road reader (16 or 0), and the PDF with its dates and trailer ID blanked. Every run's PDF must be
the same bytes; a body's count must be 16 where it is marked and 0 where its old copy answered. A count of 0 where
16 is wanted fails by name: that run measured the old road. The harness also checks that each copy here is still
the text of utilities' body, the mark aside.
